WEBVTT

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:04.890
As one encounter led to a double romance...

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.700
...three beating hearts...

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:09.100
...played gentle melodies.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:12.400
I, Kasuga Kyosuke, 15 years old...

00:00:12.510 --> 00:00:15.030
...am living the best years of my youth!

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:30.350
That's the accelerator screamin',
as the tires are squealin'...

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:36.860
...takin' you along, a girl I hardly knew,
in my speedin' coupe.

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:42.630
You slammed the door,
evadin' the shadows that followed...

00:00:42.740 --> 00:00:49.370
...sayin' "Take me anywhere, Just go!"

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:52.280
An encounter is like a highway junction...

00:00:52.380 --> 00:00:55.350
I've fallen in love with you - that I realized...

00:00:55.450 --> 00:01:01.390
...by the time the seaport was in sight...

00:01:01.490 --> 00:01:04.480
"Take me to Summer Side"

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:13.260
Sayin' that you desire
tenderness over a caress...

00:01:13.370 --> 00:01:16.600
"Night of Summer Side"

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:25.610
...the way you avoided me, usin' that
naive look, wasn't so innocent.

00:01:25.710 --> 00:01:28.910
"Take me to Summer Side"

00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:37.690
Sayin' that you desire
a caress over loneliness...

00:01:37.790 --> 00:01:41.130
"Night of Summer Side"

00:01:41.230 --> 00:01:51.500
...the way you looked into my eyes as
you turned back wasn't so innocent.

00:01:59.250 --> 00:02:05.190
A Little Lemony Kiss for Her.

00:02:59.040 --> 00:03:01.010
"So... what is it that you wanted
to talk to me about?"

00:03:03.480 --> 00:03:06.280
"Well, the truth is... the truth is...

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:24.790
"...the first time I met you,
by those steps...

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:32.010
"l fell in...

00:03:37.010 --> 00:03:40.450
"...love with you. "

00:03:40.650 --> 00:03:43.620
"l... I didn't know... "

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:47.380
"Madoka... "

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:50.320
"Kyosuke... "

00:04:03.870 --> 00:04:06.270
Madoka...

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:28.460
You liar!

00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:31.160
You're lying! You know the truth,
don't you, Manami?!

00:04:31.470 --> 00:04:33.260
Oh, c'mon, how should I know?

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:34.700
Never mind that! Help me with this...

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:37.800
What's going on?! How can you be
arguing this early in the morning?

00:04:37.970 --> 00:04:42.710
Huh? Forget about it. This kinda thing
has nothing to do with you, Oniichan.

00:04:42.810 --> 00:04:46.340
Hey, I mean, they say
"a kiss tastes like a lemon...!"

00:04:46.510 --> 00:04:46.580
"...a kiss...?!"

00:04:46.580 --> 00:04:48.780
Oh, stop it, Kurumi!
"...a kiss...?!"

00:04:48.950 --> 00:04:52.390
Tell the truth, you little...!
Well...? Out with it!

00:04:52.550 --> 00:04:53.790
Kyosuke...

00:04:53.790 --> 00:04:55.120
Huh?

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:58.490
I'm told that you used the Power yesterday.

00:04:58.660 --> 00:04:59.890
What?!

00:05:02.260 --> 00:05:04.030
W...Well...

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:07.800
Well, you used it with
good intentions, I hear...

00:05:07.900 --> 00:05:11.460
...but if you aren't more careful,
we'll be making the movers rich again.

00:05:11.940 --> 00:05:15.600
I know that! Sheesh!

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:17.380
You and your big mouth!

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:19.740
Hmm? Bumble-bumble-bumble...
You and your big mouth!

00:05:19.910 --> 00:05:22.710
Kurumi... lying is a bad thing!

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:24.850
Why you! You little big-mouthed raccoon!

00:05:26.790 --> 00:05:29.450
Dad, you're a liar!

00:05:29.560 --> 00:05:31.530
You told me you'd keep that a secret!

00:05:33.460 --> 00:05:35.490
Oh, but, you see...

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:37.390
Huh? Hey, Jingoro! Where are you going?

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:46.100
Hey, you! You've got to eat during
your meal time, or else!

00:06:03.390 --> 00:06:07.190
Tsk-tsk!               No-no!

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:17.130
I knew that I shouldn't use the Power...
even without Dad's scolding.

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:28.770
Uh-oh!

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:33.480
I'm late! I'm late!

00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:47.630
A...Ayukawa!

00:06:57.240 --> 00:07:00.650
Hmph! It'd be awful if I got slapped again!

00:07:03.220 --> 00:07:04.650
It's all right...

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:06.550
What?

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:09.520
The teacher. He's not here yet.

00:07:12.190 --> 00:07:15.320
I walk down the hallway
at the same time every day.

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:16.830
And, when I do...

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:20.960
...the teacher comes up the stairs
30 seconds later!

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:26.340
Hear what I mean?!

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:32.840
I've gotta be honest...
Ayukawa is indeed cute!

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:37.310
She must've been in
a bad mood yesterday...

00:07:37.420 --> 00:07:39.350
...or so I thought...

00:07:42.620 --> 00:07:46.420
I've got to try my best to avoid
having to move out of town...

00:07:46.790 --> 00:07:49.390
...or so I thought...

00:08:01.980 --> 00:08:04.340
What're you doing, if I may ask?

00:08:04.510 --> 00:08:09.640
W...W...Well, n... Hot, isn't it!

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:14.880
Really! I don't know what Ayukawa is thinking...

00:08:14.990 --> 00:08:16.960
Nope... I don't have a clue!

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:28.900
That's Sugimoto from Homeroom "B."

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:34.000
Lemme see... According to last year's data,
her breast size is 78 cm!

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:36.600
So, it should easily be 80+ by now!

00:08:38.350 --> 00:08:40.610
Oh, 'tis such remarkable progress!

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:46.940
Wow!

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:50.910
Er... The score was 9.3... 9.3!

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:55.360
Next... Ayukawa...

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:06.640
Okey-dokey, looks like our team's up!

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:10.840
W...What about Ayukawa's score?

00:09:11.010 --> 00:09:13.540
I... don't associate myself with delinquents.

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:16.120
Come on! Our game!

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:20.150
Sugimoto, that was great!

00:09:20.150 --> 00:09:21.750
Yeah, that was great!
Sugimoto, that was great!

00:09:21.860 --> 00:09:24.830
No wonder you're in the Gym Club!
That was awesome!

00:10:11.140 --> 00:10:15.730
What I saw was... so great...
that I didn't realize...

00:10:34.930 --> 00:10:37.920
Don't stop! Finish what you're supposed to!

00:10:39.270 --> 00:10:41.130
...can you believe that?!

00:10:41.300 --> 00:10:44.270
...even then, unconsciously l...

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:11.460
OOOPS!

00:11:11.630 --> 00:11:14.360
C'mon! C'mon! Over there!

00:11:14.470 --> 00:11:16.770
C'mon! Block him!

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:17.040
Here! Kasuga!

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:18.660
C'mon! Go for it!
Here! Kasuga!

00:11:18.840 --> 00:11:20.860
Show me what you've got!

00:11:21.040 --> 00:11:22.600
Fine! I'll show ya...

00:11:22.780 --> 00:11:25.110
Oh? He's confident!

00:11:25.280 --> 00:11:26.470
...or so I said, but...

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:27.050
Oh?

00:11:27.050 --> 00:11:28.620
Huh?

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:29.120
It's in! One more minute!

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:31.140
Yeah! Nice shot!

00:11:33.490 --> 00:11:34.590
Man, am I beat!

00:11:34.590 --> 00:11:35.120
Kasuga!

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:36.890
Oh?

00:11:36.890 --> 00:11:39.450
Go for it! It's comeback time!

00:11:46.730 --> 00:11:46.830
Oh!

00:11:46.830 --> 00:11:47.890
What the...?!
Oh!

00:11:48.900 --> 00:11:50.240
A...Ayukawa's watching!

00:11:50.240 --> 00:11:51.070
Over there!
A...Ayukawa's watching!

00:11:51.070 --> 00:11:51.140
Over there!

00:11:51.140 --> 00:11:52.800
C'mon! C'mon!
Over there!

00:11:53.710 --> 00:11:56.900
If... If I could win the game...

00:11:57.710 --> 00:12:01.550
...then maybe... just maybe
my dream will come true...

00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:03.620
...and it won't have to be a dream!

00:12:05.220 --> 00:12:09.250
Of course! If I use the Power
without anyone noticing...

00:12:09.360 --> 00:12:11.220
But... But...

00:13:01.950 --> 00:13:06.080
If I'd used the Power,
I could have turned the game around.

00:13:06.190 --> 00:13:10.780
But... but, showing her the best of me
by using the Power...

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:14.060
...felt like I'd be deceiving Ayukawa...

00:13:16.800 --> 00:13:18.360
"Game over!"

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:25.970
On second thought...
maybe I should've used the Power!

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:49.720
Oh? It's the brother of those bratty twins!

00:13:49.830 --> 00:13:52.560
Look at that! What a creep!

00:13:57.840 --> 00:14:01.570
I wonder... what the look on
Ayukawa's face was at that moment...

00:14:25.730 --> 00:14:26.960
N... No way!

00:14:32.870 --> 00:14:35.570
No doubt about it... He's...

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:37.270
...pretty awesome!

00:14:38.880 --> 00:14:42.280
Holy cow! Oh, boy! He's cute!

00:14:42.420 --> 00:14:45.320
"Year 1, Homeroom 'C' (Grade 7)"

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:54.020
Well? How's the Tamago-yaki?
Was it a bit too sweet?
"Tamago-yaki:" an omelet-like egg dish.

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:56.100
Lemme see here...

00:14:58.270 --> 00:15:00.460
Delicious! It's wonderful!

00:15:00.570 --> 00:15:01.970
And the sausages...?

00:15:01.970 --> 00:15:04.100
Super! Super!

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:08.470
Did you guys really make that
all by yourselves?

00:15:09.040 --> 00:15:12.910
We make our brother's too, so mornings
are rather busy! Right, Manami?

00:15:13.080 --> 00:15:13.380
Uh-huh!

00:15:13.380 --> 00:15:15.850
Oh, my! Your brother's too?
Uh-huh!

00:15:16.020 --> 00:15:19.510
And, this brother of yours...
does he prefer certain types or...?

00:15:22.960 --> 00:15:26.950
No, I meant "food," when I was asking
about his tastes! Food!

00:15:27.060 --> 00:15:31.460
You silly! I wasn't asking about what
kind of wom... or girls he likes!

00:15:31.570 --> 00:15:34.360
Oh, c'mon!

00:15:38.210 --> 00:15:39.870
How 'bout an after-meal treat?

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:41.840
What?!
How 'bout an after-meal treat?

00:15:44.610 --> 00:15:47.210
Don't be so modest.

00:15:47.320 --> 00:15:50.280
Oh? Okay, I'll get some milk for you!

00:15:52.190 --> 00:15:54.320
What's come over Hikaru?

00:15:54.320 --> 00:15:55.790
Bumble-bumble, I dunno!

00:15:56.090 --> 00:15:58.460
Why you! Don't lay your hands on my lunch!

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:01.530
C'mon! It's mine!

00:16:12.970 --> 00:16:14.510
I got it! I got it!

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:16.100
I still wonder...
I got it! I got it!

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:20.210
At last, believe it or not... I got my hands
on some, for the first time in 4 days!

00:16:20.880 --> 00:16:22.380
G... Got what?

00:16:22.380 --> 00:16:23.920
Ta-da! The legendary Cutlet Sandwich!
G... Got what?

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:24.050
Ta-da! The legendary Cutlet Sandwich!

00:16:24.050 --> 00:16:24.550
Ah!
Ta-da! The legendary Cutlet Sandwich!

00:16:24.550 --> 00:16:24.690
Ah!

00:16:24.690 --> 00:16:26.120
Oh, no, you don't!

00:16:26.220 --> 00:16:29.620
I mean, look how tough it is to get one of these!

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:31.550
Ta-da!

00:16:32.930 --> 00:16:37.230
How did you... manage to get a hold of
TWO glorious Cutlet Sandwiches?!

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:39.370
Skill, my boy. Skill.

00:16:39.730 --> 00:16:40.740
Shit!

00:16:40.740 --> 00:16:41.260
Easy, easy...
Shit!

00:16:41.440 --> 00:16:45.240
Oh... speaking of which, Kasuga...
why aren't you over there buying lunch?

00:16:45.810 --> 00:16:49.440
Huh? Oh! My sisters make me a bento lunch, so...
"Bento:" prepared box lunch, often quite artistically prepared.

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:51.340
A b...bento?!

00:16:51.450 --> 00:16:53.410
Y...Y'mean those cute sisters of yours make 'em...

00:16:53.510 --> 00:16:56.450
...with those c...cute hands of theirs?!

00:16:58.820 --> 00:17:01.190
Ir...Irresistible!

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:04.090
Kasuga! No, I mean, Kasuga, dear chum!
Share my Cutlet Sandwich!

00:17:04.190 --> 00:17:06.320
So, in exchange, I want your sisters...

00:17:06.430 --> 00:17:08.700
...I mean, their bento...

00:17:08.700 --> 00:17:09.490
Wh...What the...?

00:17:09.660 --> 00:17:09.960
All right!

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:11.360
Oh! Why, that punk!
All right!

00:17:11.530 --> 00:17:14.830
He's trying to beat me to them!
Hold it right there, Hatta!

00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:18.130
H...Hey, wait a minute!
That's my bento!

00:17:18.740 --> 00:17:20.710
Hold it! Hold it, you!

00:17:20.880 --> 00:17:22.070
I won't! No way!

00:17:23.280 --> 00:17:24.750
Dear Sweet Milk!

00:17:24.750 --> 00:17:26.840
Hatta! Hold it, you!
Dear Sweet Milk!

00:17:27.750 --> 00:17:30.220
You shouldn't be running in the hallway!

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:43.600
Hot Damn! No way! Am I dreaming?!
Did l... just now...

00:17:53.140 --> 00:17:54.940
Y...You...

00:17:55.110 --> 00:17:57.600
What the hell...?

00:18:00.750 --> 00:18:02.720
What the hell are you guys doing?!

00:18:02.880 --> 00:18:04.410
Oh! Er... well... you see...

00:18:04.590 --> 00:18:07.380
I'm no match for him! Time to split!

00:18:07.560 --> 00:18:10.550
Wh... Hey, you!

00:18:10.790 --> 00:18:13.820
See ya, Darling!

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:14.730
"Darling?!"

00:18:14.730 --> 00:18:17.250
"Darling..." she said?! Why, you!
"Darling?!"

00:18:31.310 --> 00:18:34.870
One, two! One, two!

00:18:35.020 --> 00:18:35.380
"Faculty Office"

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:39.340
Kasuga! Y...You...
"Faculty Office"

00:18:41.160 --> 00:18:43.620
Be calm, Mr. Otsuka!
Violence won't solve anything!

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:46.450
Besides, Kasuga is new to our school.

00:18:46.630 --> 00:18:49.790
Well, why won't he confess and apologize?!

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:55.730
B...But, sir... you cited me for
"illicit sexual conduct in the hallway!"

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:58.170
I won't let you deny it!

00:18:58.270 --> 00:19:00.670
Besides, you just switched schools!
How dare you!

00:19:00.780 --> 00:19:03.440
Don't you know that Hiyama Hikaru
is a student who...

00:19:03.610 --> 00:19:05.200
"Hikaru?"

00:19:06.380 --> 00:19:07.850
Thank you.

00:19:10.690 --> 00:19:15.120
Start at the Vice-Principal's desk,
then do this part of the office.

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:17.220
...not only has a filthy mouth...

00:19:17.330 --> 00:19:19.620
...but she's known to hang out with
a bunch of delinquents!

00:19:19.790 --> 00:19:23.090
Please, go easy, Mr. Otsuka...
Kasuga didn't know that...

00:19:23.260 --> 00:19:26.030
Hogwash! How we begin things
is all-important, Mr. Matsuoka!

00:19:27.440 --> 00:19:28.560
"Kasuga?!"

00:19:28.740 --> 00:19:32.190
Punishing a female student who's violated school rules...

00:19:32.310 --> 00:19:34.070
...by making her arrange flowers...

00:19:34.180 --> 00:19:37.310
...is more-or-less pointless, isn't it?

00:19:37.310 --> 00:19:39.400
You may be right, but oh well...
...is more-or-less pointless, isn't it?

00:19:39.580 --> 00:19:42.910
B...But, sir... Even though she
might look like a delinquent...

00:19:43.080 --> 00:19:45.610
...that alone... doesn't mean
she is a delinquent, does it?

00:19:45.790 --> 00:19:47.750
What did you say, you...?!

00:19:47.920 --> 00:19:50.150
LIKE a delinquent, or IS a delinquent,
it's all the same thing!

00:19:50.260 --> 00:19:52.420
Don't try to confuse me with
some stupid argument!

00:19:52.590 --> 00:19:56.650
But... it's not like she's done
anything really wrong.

00:19:56.760 --> 00:20:01.220
If you label her like that...
it wouldn't be fair.

00:20:01.400 --> 00:20:03.270
T...T...T...Twerp!

00:20:03.370 --> 00:20:07.210
You just got here, and the punks
have already recruited you!

00:20:07.380 --> 00:20:08.980
N...No, that's not what I meant...

00:20:08.980 --> 00:20:11.240
M...Mr. Otsuka!
N...No, that's not what I meant...

00:20:11.550 --> 00:20:15.680
Look, Kasuga... listen to what I say...

00:20:15.780 --> 00:20:18.120
The student named Hiyama Hikaru is...

00:20:18.390 --> 00:20:20.860
Huh? M...Mr. Otsuka...

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:22.490
...along with your classmate, Ayukawa...
Huh? M...Mr. Otsuka...

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:22.620
...along with your classmate, Ayukawa...

00:20:22.620 --> 00:20:23.120
Mr. Otsuka...
...along with your classmate, Ayukawa...

00:20:23.120 --> 00:20:23.260
Mr. Otsuka...

00:20:23.260 --> 00:20:24.280
What?!
Mr. Otsuka...

00:20:32.200 --> 00:20:33.370
Sensei...

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:34.630
Ayukawa!
Sensei...

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:39.510
Well, then... pardon me...

00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:44.140
A... Ayukawa...

00:20:45.550 --> 00:20:50.310
Fine, Mr. Otsuka! Let's discuss exactly
what it is that makes me a delinquent!

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:54.820
For some reason...
I suddenly felt quite bold...

00:21:25.890 --> 00:21:27.880
Well done.

00:21:34.700 --> 00:21:36.660
Ayukawa!

00:21:40.530 --> 00:21:42.660
Your bag... It feels rather light.

00:21:43.040 --> 00:21:46.630
My bag? You took the trouble to bring it to me?!

00:21:47.370 --> 00:21:53.310
Well... wouldn't you be in big trouble
if some delinquent had stolen it?

00:21:54.980 --> 00:21:55.220
"Leave without me -- Madoka"

00:21:55.220 --> 00:21:57.780
Huh? What's this?
"Leave without me -- Madoka"

00:21:58.390 --> 00:22:01.790
Hmph! Oh, well, enough for today.

00:22:49.870 --> 00:22:51.840
What is it?

00:22:52.010 --> 00:22:54.000
Oh, nothing!

00:22:55.780 --> 00:23:00.370
If I reach out towards your red lips,
there right before my eyes...

00:23:00.480 --> 00:23:04.040
...if I just reach out with all my might...

00:23:04.150 --> 00:23:07.140
...maybe I can touch them.

00:23:08.260 --> 00:23:12.210
That's the feeling that I got...
during that sunset.

00:23:31.780 --> 00:23:33.510
Oh! Jingoro!

00:23:34.220 --> 00:23:37.480
Why, you! How dare you?!
You good-for-nothing!

00:23:39.790 --> 00:23:42.920
Why, you!

00:23:43.520 --> 00:23:45.860
Let go of it, you! Hey!

00:23:45.960 --> 00:23:48.490
Hey! Let go, I said!

00:23:57.940 --> 00:24:05.500
I dream of casting a spell that
captures your heart...

00:24:05.610 --> 00:24:13.080
...and makes you crazy about me.

00:24:13.190 --> 00:24:28.430
Love is deja vu; an unfamiliar memory.
I feel our lips pressing together.

00:24:28.540 --> 00:24:41.040
Love me... tenderly...
Golden Summer Mirage...

00:24:41.150 --> 00:24:51.250
Someday... Someday...
Please let my body feel your lips...

00:24:51.360 --> 00:24:58.260
...on that morning I'll be called your lover.

00:24:58.370 --> 00:25:09.710
Someday, someday...
I'll be waiting for that moment.

00:25:13.250 --> 00:25:15.610
I... right in front of Ayukawa...

00:25:15.720 --> 00:25:20.180
...er... slow-danced with Hikaru!

00:25:20.290 --> 00:25:23.550
To top it off, I promised
to go out on a date!

00:25:23.660 --> 00:25:25.820
A... Ayukawa! Wait a second!

00:25:25.930 --> 00:25:27.760
What I really feel is that...

00:25:27.860 --> 00:25:31.760
Next time:
"Feelings Stirred - The Rolling First-Date."
